<title>UK: Turkey seeks 100,000 tonnes gas oil in Dec - trade.</title>
<headline>Turkey seeks 100,000 tonnes gas oil in Dec - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish state oil company Tupras has issued a purchase tender for 100,000 tonnes of 0.5 percent sulphur gas oil for December, traders said.</p>
<p>It follows a purchase of 225,000 tonnes for November.</p>
<p>The latest tender calls for four cargoes of 25,000 tonnes each. The tender closes on November 18, with responses due by November 20.</p>
<p>-- William Maclean, London newsroom +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
